WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:15.550
"Oh no!" Cook said.

2
00:00:15.551 --> 00:00:18.813
"I lost my cookbook!

3
00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:21.765
The king's feast is tonight.

4
00:00:21.766 --> 00:00:25.810
I cannot make food without my cookbook!"

5
00:00:25.811 --> 00:00:29.324
"I will find your cookbook!" Tom said.

6
00:00:29.325 --> 00:00:31.586
He waved his wand.

7
00:00:31.587 --> 00:00:35.177
"Have a look! Find the book!"

8
00:00:35.178 --> 00:00:37.491
Poof!

9
00:00:37.492 --> 00:00:40.565
Tom heard a loud bang.

10
00:00:40.566 --> 00:00:43.240
But no cookbook appeared.

11
00:00:43.241 --> 00:00:47.319
Then Dirk rushed into the Royal Kitchen.

12
00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:53.440
"The queen was reading in the library," Dirk snapped.

13
00:00:53.441 --> 00:00:56.443
"And a bookshelf exploded.

14
00:00:56.444 --> 00:00:58.937
Did you do that, Tom?"

15
00:00:58.938 --> 00:01:01.924
"Oops," Tom said.

16
00:01:01.925 --> 00:01:06.262
"We are looking for my cookbook," Cook said.

17
00:01:06.263 --> 00:01:08.981
"Find it!" Dirk said.

18
00:01:08.982 --> 00:01:11.718
"The lords and knights will arrive soon.

19
00:01:11.719 --> 00:01:16.957
The king's feast must be perfect!"

20
00:01:16.958 --> 00:01:20.385
Dirk left the kitchen.

21
00:01:20.386 --> 00:01:26.403
"Help me look, Tom!" Cook said.

22
00:01:26.404 --> 00:01:35.662
They looked all over the castle.

23
00:01:35.663 --> 00:01:41.418
They looked on shelves and under tables.

24
00:01:41.419 --> 00:01:45.389
They looked in the pantry and the Royal Garden.

25
00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:49.764
They did not find the cookbook.

26
00:01:49.765 --> 00:01:56.813
Finally they returned to the kitchen.

27
00:01:56.814 --> 00:02:01.897
Cook clutched her apron. "This is terrible!"

28
00:02:01.898 --> 00:02:04.898
"I have an idea!" Tom said.

29
00:02:04.899 --> 00:02:07.758
"I will make a magic powder.

30
00:02:07.759 --> 00:02:10.992
It will make your food taste good!"

31
00:02:10.993 --> 00:02:14.647
"Please do that, Tom," Cook said.

32
00:02:14.648 --> 00:02:18.677
"I can't cook without my cookbook!"

33
00:02:18.678 --> 00:02:21.746
Dirk poked his head into the kitchen.

34
00:02:21.747 --> 00:02:24.431
"Your spell must work, Wizard!

35
00:02:24.432 --> 00:02:36.218
Or you will both go to the Grim Dungeon!"

